# Agora SDK tarballs and the agora_rtc wrapper source. Large binaries and
# vendor source that are fetched separately, not carried in this repo.
/agora/

# ...but the built aarch64 packages are carried, so an arm64 board can install
# them without a toolchain or an SDK download. *.so is ignored repo-wide, so
# this path needs an explicit exception -- and a second one in
# ai_agents/agents/.gitignore, whose `lib/` rule sits nearer the files and so
# wins over this one. In both places the directory has to be re-included
# before its contents can be: git does not descend into an excluded directory.
!/ai_agents/agents/prebuilt/
!/ai_agents/agents/prebuilt/**

# Ambarella AI Developer Kit (N1-655 / Cooper Pro) documentation. A 24 MB
# Doxygen export of vendor material marked confidential and proprietary --
# obtained from Ambarella, not redistributable through this repository.
/ambarella_ai_developer_kit_doc/

# Customer project material. Architecture documents and figures produced for a
# named customer engagement -- confidential, and this repository is a fork
# pushed to a hosted remote. Kept out of git entirely rather than relied on to
# be noticed at review time.
docs/development/*convoai_oracle*
docs/development/1.PNG

# Design notes and implementation plans written while building the ambarella
# and sherpa-onnx extensions. Working material, not documentation: what they
# describe is in docs/development/ and in the code. Untracked from
# 2026-09-17; earlier commits still carry them.
docs/superpowers/
